{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01CjDoBxC9ccrG3Ktd2KzDAY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01AdPuvddGYeUnkDK676rxuq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = \"/workspace/TODO.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\"- [ ] **sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares** *(uses cast-from-exile; token + prepared)*\",\n\"\"\"- [x] **sos_13 — Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares** *(uses cast-from-exile; token + prepared)*\n  *(Notes: per RULEBOOK 722.3c the prepare copy is created in exile when the\n  permanent becomes prepared and is cast at its normal cost — not free; engine\n  `cast_spell` gained an additive `from_zone` param for this. ETB effect lives\n  in `on_resolve` like fdn_205 — the engine fires the ETB event before the\n  entering card registers triggers, so self-ETB registrations never fire.)*\"\"\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n- **sos_13 — prepared per rule 722, not the TODO sketch.** RULEBOOK 722.3c:\n  the prepare-spell copy is created in exile *as the permanent becomes\n  prepared* (not at election time) and \"may be cast\" — at its normal {W} cost,\n  not free; TODO said `cast_spell_free` but deferred to the rulebook on cost.\n  `cast_spell` gained an additive `from_zone: Zone = Zone.HAND` parameter so\n  the copy is cast from exile through the normal paying pipeline. Casting it\n  unprepares the permanent (on_cast); the resolved copy ceases to exist (a\n  one-shot replacement prevents the graveyard move); the copy vanishes if the\n  permanent leaves the battlefield. A countered copy still hits the graveyard\n  (counter path bypasses move_to_zone) — noted limitation.\n- **Self-ETB convention.** The engine fires EntersBattlefield BEFORE the\n  entering permanent registers its own triggers, so \"when this enters\" must be\n  implemented in `on_resolve` (graded fdn_205 does this). sos_13 follows that;\n  its \"opponent controls more creatures than you\" count adds 1 for itself\n  while still on the stack.\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_13: Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Mark TODO, log decisions, commit sos_13"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":303217,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":933},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f78a1a0-95d3-47a1-b250-e533ca8f770c","uuid":"ffc6197d-d374-49fa-8b7b-d7f1b421703a","request_id":"req_011CbvtL8svpyM8Bd73a3UgZ"}
