{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01TWfmEEiMLnCt5YFEMmgSLQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01VtmJiAAuaDWpV4j5XAie8N","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\np = \"/workspace/TODO.md\"\ns = open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\"- [ ] **sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer**\", \"- [x] **sos_97 — Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer**\")\nopen(p, \"w\").write(s)\nEOF\ncat >> /workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md <<'EOF'\n\n- **sos_97 — loyalty targets, surveil, coins, skip-turns.**\n  `LoyaltyAbilityInstance` gained an optional trailing `targets` field;\n  `_activate_loyalty_ability` now mirrors `_resolve_spell` by setting\n  `source.chosen_targets` from the activation's targets at resolve time (this\n  is the \"engine sets it\" path the TODO described — it did not exist yet).\n  Surveil 2 = one yes/no per card, top card first; kept cards stay in their\n  original relative order (reordering not modelled — noted in code).\n  Coin flips use `game.rng` (`random.Random`), created lazily if absent so\n  tests can seed it. Skip-turns: `player.skip_turns` decremented in\n  `advance_phase`'s normal rotation only (no interplay with the extra-turns\n  queue — commented limitation). −1's discard is mandatory once targeted; on\n  script exhaustion the last card is discarded (fdn_57's fallback pattern).\nEOF\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_97: Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer\" && git log --oneline -1","description":"Mark TODO, log decisions, commit sos_97"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1302,"cache_read_input_tokens":339285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1302},"output_tokens":57,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f78a1a0-95d3-47a1-b250-e533ca8f770c","uu