{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_015BsjWvUp3u5GW8jdikR7zd","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed. The full suite passes: **1257 tests** (1145 engine regression + FDN reference + 66 new SOS tests), with zero regressions and all 13 TODO items checked off — one commit per item.\n\n**What was built:**\n\n*Shared engine changes (E1–E3, plus gaps discovered along the way — all additive):*\n- `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from `cast_spell` **and** `cast_spell_free` (free-casting is still casting per rule 601); `copy_spell` copies correctly don't fire it.\n- New `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fired from `advance_phase` after mana pools empty.\n- `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents.\n- Found-and-fixed dormant seams the plan assumed existed: `AttacksTriggeredEvent` was never fired (now fired in `declare_attackers_step`), and replacement effects never applied to spells headed to the graveyard (new `SpellToGraveyardReplacementEvent` routed through `_resolve_spell`).\n- Small additions for single cards: `mana_spent` recorded at payment, restricted instant/sorcery-only mana in `ManaPool`, `from_zone` param on `cast_spell`, loyalty activation targets mirrored into `chosen_targets`, `skip_turns` honored in turn rotation, and `set_board_state` now registers triggers for battlefield placements.\n\n*The ten cards*, each with 5–9 real-engine tests plus an independent throwaway smoke check: Together as One (converge), The Dawning Archaic (cost reduction + attack-cast + exile-instead), Witherbloom (affinity self + grant), Silverquill (casualty 1), Great Hall (restricted mana + in-place animation), Mana Sculpt (counter + delayed mana), Improvisation Capstone (impulse exile + Paradigm), Emeritus of Truce (prepared per rule 722), Lorehold (miracle + upkeep loot), Ral Zarek (surveil/discard/reanimate/coin-flip skip-turns).\n\n**Notable spec-over-plan deviations** (logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md` and as TODO notes): the prepared copy for sos_13 is created in exile when the permanent becomes prepared and is cast at its **normal {W} cost** — rule 722.3c overrode the TODO's free-cast sketch; and \"when this creature enters\" effects live in `on_resolve` following the graded fdn_205 convention, since the engine fires the ETB event before an entering card registers its own triggers."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":522,"cache_read_input_tokens":342158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":522},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f78a1a0-95d3-47a1-b250-e533ca8f770c","uuid":"49e4b784-e7ce-4f60-9e88-d936d13768df","request_id":"req_011CbvtzYgiDcjeRTu4z6zXP"}
